1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:00,730
Hi, guys.

2
00:00:00,740 --> 00:00:02,350
Happy to see you today.

3
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:10,430
Let's practice talking about website and we're going to use phrases like there is and there are.

4
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:11,960
There is.

5
00:00:11,990 --> 00:00:15,110
We use the risk to talk about one thing.

6
00:00:15,230 --> 00:00:21,020
For example, there is a lot of useful information on this website.

7
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:26,810
Information is uncountable, so we use the risk with it.

8
00:00:27,470 --> 00:00:28,160
Okay.

9
00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:37,880
We can also say there is a career page on this website or there isn't any career page on this website

10
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:42,950
or there is no career page on this website.

11
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:44,090
Good.

12
00:00:44,390 --> 00:00:49,250
There are we use there are to talk about many things.

13
00:00:49,250 --> 00:00:55,400
For example, there are a lot of cool features on this website.

14
00:00:55,400 --> 00:01:00,620
There are too many notifications on this page.

15
00:01:00,620 --> 00:01:07,220
There aren't any buttons on this website.

16
00:01:07,610 --> 00:01:12,530
There aren't any ads on this page.

17
00:01:13,430 --> 00:01:19,850
Very good to talk about a location of something on a web page.

18
00:01:19,850 --> 00:01:28,310
We can use phrases like top right corner or bottom left corner.

19
00:01:28,310 --> 00:01:41,510
For example, there is a big donate button at the top right corner of this page, or there are social

20
00:01:41,510 --> 00:01:48,500
media icons at the bottom left corner of this page.

21
00:01:49,100 --> 00:01:49,820
Good.

22
00:01:49,820 --> 00:01:53,210
Now you know how to describe a website.

23
00:01:53,630 --> 00:02:02,670
Also, if you want to talk about the look of the website, you can use phrases like clear, informative,

24
00:02:02,700 --> 00:02:10,440
easy to navigate, user friendly, stylish, well designed, intuitive and interactive.

25
00:02:10,470 --> 00:02:18,540
For example, you can say I really like using this website because it's clear, informative and easy

26
00:02:18,540 --> 00:02:19,740
to navigate.

27
00:02:20,460 --> 00:02:22,050
Very good guys.

28
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:28,470
Please repeat the phrases, remember them and use them to describe your favorite website.

29
00:02:28,500 --> 00:02:31,170
Thank you and see you next time.

30
00:02:31,290 --> 00:02:32,130
Bye.
